# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug/
target/

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/

# Added by cargo

/target

# Custom
.DS_Store
BACKLOG.md
FINDINGS.md
_prompts

# Internal-only documents (not published) — the design notes CONCEPT.md was split
# into, plus concepts/references/, the third-party specifications and RFCs they
# are written against. Those are copyrighted publications, so this entry is a
# licensing boundary as well as an editorial one: publishing the notes would mean
# extracting them from the material they sit beside.
concepts/

# Agent instructions. The round procedure reads concepts/ on every phase, so it
# describes a tree a clone does not have — and it is internal working method
# rather than anything a consumer of this crate needs.
.claude/

# Python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
uv.lock
# Zola build output
site/public/
